comprovada dos executantes\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Registros das opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0562\0562\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Adequa\134u00e7\134u00e3o dos materiais em contato com a \134u00e1gua\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Superf\134u00edcies lisas\054 \134u00edntegras e higieniz\134u00e1veis\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0562\0567\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Execu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o da canaliza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o e registros\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0562\0568\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Desmonte e frequ\134u00eancia de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o de incrusta\134u00e7\134u00f5es e revis\134u00e3o das opera\134u00e7\134u00f5es\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\135\054 \0424\0562\0569\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042POP\072 m\134u00e9todo\054 concentra\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 tempo e temperatura\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Exist\134u00eancia e atualiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o documental do POP\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0563\0562\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Materiais e superf\134u00edcies do reservat\134u00f3rio\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Conserva\134u00e7\134u00e3o\054 aus\134u00eancia de vazamentos e acesso \134u00e0 inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0563\0563\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Extravasor\054 tela\054 v\134u00e1lvula\057sif\134u00e3o e dispositivo de esvaziamento\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Filtra\134u00e7\134u00e3o microbiol\134u00f3gica do ar\072 desempenho e integridade\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Torneira de coleta de amostras\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Verifica\134u00e7\134u00e3o e troca dos elementos filtrantes\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Registros de verifica\134u00e7\134u00e3o e troca\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0563\0564\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o visual peri\134u00f3dica e a\134u00e7\134u00e3o sobre incrusta\134u00e7\134u00f5es\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\135\054 \0424\0563\0565\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Execu\134u00e7\134u00e3o da higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o do reservat\134u00f3rio\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Capacita\134u00e7\134u00e3o e registros\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0563\0566\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042POP e par\134u00e2metros de higieniza\134u00e7\134u00e3o do reservat\134u00f3rio\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPHO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Disponibilidade e atualiza\134u00e7\134u00e3o do documento\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0565\0562\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042\134u00c1rea distinta para recep\134u00e7\134u00e3o de retorn\134u00e1veis\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPR\042\175\135\054 \0424\0565\0563\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o e rejei\134u00e7\134u00e3o de insumos fora da especifica\134u00e7\134u00e3o\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\054 \173\042texto\042\072 \042Regulariza\134u00e7\134u00e3o documental dos saneantes\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PC\042\175\135\054 \0424\0565\0564\042\072 \133\173\042texto\042\072 \042Inspe\134u00e7\134u00e3o individual de res\134u00edduos\054 odor e integridade\042\054 \042cat\042\072 \042PPRO\042\175\054 \173\042